  "entry": "E13",
  "article": "Nvidia offers to take a cut of AI cloud revenue on top of hardware sales in new optional financing vehicle — trades tokens for revenue cut",
  "gold_statement": "the agreement runs for six years and covers 72 MW of new Australian data center capacity",
  "gold_meaning": {
